    "turn_text": "Let's talk about that topic. I want to play a little bit of sound for you. Trump supporters have a new rallying cry. This was the scene at an event on Wednesday in North Carolina. Let's take a listen. Now, sent her back is obviously a reference to Congresswoman Ilhan Omar of Minnesota. She's an American citizen, but was born in Somalia. Trump earlier this week sent out a tweet that you just referenced, referencing Omar and three other progressive Congresswoman, Ayana Presley, Massachusetts, Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez of New York, and Rashida Talib of Michigan. saying that they should go back to their countries of origin. The three just rattled off, of course, were born in America. Does it surprise you how well the president's tactics resonate with a lot of people?",
