      },
      {
        "text": "There is no doubt that the success of a school depends directly on having a great teacher and a great principal.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "A contract must allow for supporting great teachers through professional development.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "A contract must allow for removing underperforming teachers.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Contracts should create opportunities to identify and retain high-performing educators.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "It is not possible to build a successful education system by punishing teachers and principals.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Research demonstrates that excellent teachers and great principals significantly impact student outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
